+### Formulas
+*   Noise generation: $\mathbf{n} \sim \mathcal{N}(0, \text{noise\_std}^2)$ [S1][S2, unofficial].
+*   Noisy density: $\sigma' = \sigma + \mathbf{n}$ [S2, unofficial].
+*   Output tensor: $\mathbf{raw}' = [\mathbf{rgb}, \sigma + \mathbf{n}]$ [S2, unofficial].
 
